Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:52.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Meet your digital twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:52.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Roll in. Rise up. Make it yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:01:12.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Your height. Your rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:01:12.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}From seated focus to a full 52.5-inch standing height.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.50,0:01:36.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}From focus to creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.50,0:01:36.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Draft at 25°. Create at 65°. Supplies find their shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:56.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}A place for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:56.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Bring your workspace into the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:02:12.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Ideas become stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:02:12.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}A personal workstation inside a collaborative media lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:28.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Make room for discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:28.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}A classroom for different ways of learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:48.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Make movement part of your day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:48.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Pause. Stand. Reset your working posture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:03:06.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Move with awareness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:03:06.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Virtual proximity sweep · simulated obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:24.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Feel the room come alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:24.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Reactive colour gives the room a different rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:42.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Music. Media. In sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:42.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}A curved cinema experience with picture-driven colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:04:04.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Make room for what’s next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:04:04.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Tilt to 65°. Park at the wall. Open the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:16.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}Your space. Reimagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:16.00,Detail,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,300)}One desk. A day of possibilities.
